            ['surah_id'=>26,'ayah_number'=>180,'arabic_text'=>'وَمَآ أَسۡـَٔلُكُمۡ عَلَيۡهِ مِنۡ أَجۡرٍۖ إِنۡ أَجۡرِيَ إِلَّا عَلَىٰ رَبِّ ٱلۡعَٰلَمِينَ','transliteration'=>'Wa-maaa as\'alukum \'alaihi min ajrin in ajriya illaa \'alaa Rabbil \'aalameen','page_number'=>374,'juz_number'=>19,'hizb_number'=>38,'is_sajdah'=>false],
