            ['surah_id'=>54,'ayah_number'=>31,'arabic_text'=>'إِنَّآ أَرۡسَلۡنَا عَلَيۡهِمۡ صَيۡحَةٗ وَٰحِدَةٗ فَكَانُواْ كَهَشِيمِ ٱلۡمُحۡتَظِرِ','transliteration'=>'Innaaa arsalnaa \'alaihim saihatanw waahidatan fakaanoo kahasheemil muhtazir','page_number'=>530,'juz_number'=>27,'hizb_number'=>53,'is_sajdah'=>false],
            ['surah_id'=>54,'ayah_number'=>32,'arabic_text'=>'وَلَقَدۡ يَسَّرۡنَا ٱلۡقُرۡءَانَ لِلذِّكۡرِ فَهَلۡ مِن مُّدَّكِرٖ','transliteration'=>'Wa-laqad yassarnal Qur\'aana liz-zikri fahal min muddakir','page_number'=>530,'juz_number'=>27,'hizb_number'=>53,'is_sajdah'=>false],
