            ['surah_id'=>68,'ayah_number'=>17,'arabic_text'=>'إِنَّا بَلَوۡنَٰهُمۡ كَمَا بَلَوۡنَآ أَصۡحَٰبَ ٱلۡجَنَّةِ إِذۡ أَقۡسَمُواْ لَيَصۡرِمُنَّهَا مُصۡبِحِينَ','transliteration'=>'Innaa balawnaahum kamaa balawnaaa As-haabal jannati iz \'aqsamoo la-yasri-munnahaa musbiheen','page_number'=>565,'juz_number'=>29,'hizb_number'=>57,'is_sajdah'=>false],
